message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "WallFin: open-source wall-finishing robot"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shah
    given-names: Salik
repository-code: "https://github.com/salikshah/wall-painter-robot"
url: "https://github.com/salikshah/wall-painter-robot"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-19
abstract: >-
  WallFin is a simulation-first wall-finishing robot project. A small
  SO-101-style arm on a rail holds a 5 N sanding force against a test wall
  through a seam, a lean and a screw head. The repository contains the
  MuJoCo simulation, force controller, acceptance tests, 1080p demos and a
  dry-rehearsed real-arm stack for Feetech STS3215 servos.
keywords:
  - wall finishing
  - sanding
  - drywall
  - force control
  - admittance control
  - robotics
  - MuJoCo
  - sim-to-real
